Keep core provenance and dependency receipt failures blocking; permit distant batching windows with publisher-cadence freshness and expose informational live predicates. Proof: real managed-launcher plugin dataclass + absolute ctypes ledger regression RED before production edits; focused new tests GREEN; seven safety mutants killed. Raw attestation unknowns and full-process CPU accounting remain unchanged.
